  m_text: '

    Thank you for playing [Title game]. This game was based on the new
    neighbourhood of Utrecht called Rijnenburg, a sustainable part of the city that
    aims to create a stronger harmony between people and nature. This will be a very
    welcoming and friendly place for anyone to live, no matter their background or
    income.



    Rijnenburg is more than just a neighbourhood, it''s a beacon of
    hope that shows us that there is always a future; no matter how dire the state
    of the world may seem. It''s also a place to build your community, your home
    and your family. Let''s build our future, together!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42b810a4df39f364283d6df737639f93, type: 2}
